        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.12,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So, you can simply say application/xml.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 38.91,
          "en": "Now, when you do that, when you send a request for XML,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.91,
          "end": 42.27,
          "en": "it'll get the XML data from the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.27,
          "end": 44.76,
          "en": "Oh, but unfortunately, it's not working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.76,
          "end": 47.04,
          "en": "You can see we got the error, which is 406.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 47.04,
          "end": 48.78,
          "en": "Why it's not working?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 49.65,
          "en": "See, the thing is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.65,
          "end": 51.87,
          "en": "whenever you want to serialize your data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 51.87,
          "end": 54.03,
          "en": "so whatever data you are sending,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 54.03,
          "end": 55.59,
          "en": "remember, all your data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 55.59,
          "end": 57.66,
          "en": "which you're returning from this server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 57.66,
          "end": 59.67,
          "en": "if you can see here for jobPosts,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 59.67,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "you are returning a list of objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 66.33,
          "en": "And what you are receiving on the client side is JSON.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 66.33,
          "end": 67.62,
          "en": "Who is converting it?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 67.62,
          "end": 68.67,
          "en": "Someone should be there, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 68.67,
          "end": 70.05,
          "en": "Otherwise, it's not magic",
