          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "and we have not added that library.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 77.64,
          "end": 80.28,
          "en": "Basically, if you can expand your external libraries,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 80.28,
          "end": 83.22,
          "en": "you will find a library called Jackson.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 83.22,
          "end": 86.03999999999999,
          "en": "Now, this is Jackson who is responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 86.03999999999999,
          "end": 88.02,
          "en": "to convert your objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 88.02,
          "end": 90.53999999999999,
          "en": "The Java objects into JSON.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 90.53999999999999,
          "end": 92.49000000000001,
          "en": "And, of course, this is not the only library available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 92.49000000000001,
          "end": 94.5,
