        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 110.74000000000001,
          "end": 113.00999999999999,
          "en": "It'll not work with XML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 113.00999999999999,
          "end": 114.42,
          "en": "If you want it to work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 114.42,
          "end": 116.88,
          "en": "basically, we have to add one more library,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 116.88,
          "end": 118.2,
          "en": "of course, of Jackson,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 118.2,
          "end": 119.88,
          "en": "but with the XML support.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 119.88,
          "end": 122.4,
          "en": "So, you have to go to your pom.xml file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 122.4,
          "end": 124.95,
          "en": "And here, we have to add that for the library,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 124.95,
          "end": 128.67,
          "en": "which is for the Jackson XML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 128.67,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "Now, to do that, I will go back to my browser,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 135.12,
          "en": "and we will go to our favorite website, mvnrepository.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 135.12,
          "end": 139.02,
          "en": "And here, you just have to search for Jackson XML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 139.02,
          "end": 140.79,
          "en": "So, this is a library which you have to use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 140.79,
          "end": 142.5,
